# Screen corpus. Syntax: see ../FORMAT.md ("Corpus files"). Each case is written through a
# headless xterm.js 6.0.0 terminal (Unicode 11 active) and dumped (attributes, modes, responses,
# title, links). `size` defaults to 80 24.

